[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-002
TITLE: Complete public runtime structures
STATEMENT: >>>
``include/zef.h`` exposes complete definitions for the pool, Message, Mailbox,
Machine, Reactor, Kernel, TopicTable, Clock, Timer, and Port structures. The
framework marks its internal members as reserved in comments rather than using
opaque handles. Caller-owned storage appears directly in the public structures
and in the Mailbox slot-array arguments.
<<<
