[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-003
TITLE: Panic boundary and ordinary results
STATEMENT: >>>
``ZResult``, ``ZPanicReason``, and ``ZPanicInfo`` are declared in
``include/zef.h``. Internal ``zef_fail`` builds a diagnostic record and calls
the externally supplied non-returning ``z_panic`` function. The library does
not provide a default panic implementation; the host smoke test supplies an
aborting handler. Expected empty, not-running, and not-found observations use
``ZResult`` while invalid arguments, lifecycle violations, ownership failures,
resource exhaustion, and state errors route through the panic boundary.
<<<
