[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-021
TITLE: Bounded state-graph validation
STATEMENT: >>>
Machine initialization checks the non-null root, root-parent relationship,
parent cycles, every declared child and sibling link, initial-child membership,
and the depth of every reachable parent chain. Runtime transition validation
checks that a target reaches the configured root within the depth limit.
Startup and dispatch track explicit lifecycle flags; startup enters the root
and follows initial links, while a self-transition leaves and re-enters the
current node before following its initial links.
<<<
