[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-060
TITLE: Linked-list Clock service
STATEMENT: >>>
The Clock keeps a caller-owned linked list with head and tail pointers rather
than a delta list. Arming appends a Timer and stores an absolute modular due
tick. Each clock tick advances the counter and scans the list for timers whose
due tick equals the current tick. Periodic timers are unlinked and appended at
their next due tick, preserving list order for same-tick expiry. Expiry only
enqueues a Message; it does not invoke application handlers.
<<<
COMMENT: Code references: include/zef.h; src/zef_timer.c.
