[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-071
TITLE: Cortex-M0 port status
STATEMENT: >>>
No Cortex-M0 critical-section, PendSV, low-power idle, or target panic source
appears in the current tree. Cortex-M0/M0+ support is explicitly deferred to
Phase 3, after the generic cooperative core and host-port acceptance. The
public ``ZPort`` callback shape is the target-neutral boundary for that later
port; the current phase makes no target-support claim.
<<<
