[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-IMP-080
TITLE: Current consumer and behavior tests
STATEMENT: >>>
``tests/zef_smoke_test.c`` and ``tests/zef_test_work.c`` include the public
header and link the built library. The smoke executable covers the compact
end-to-end path. The traceable test-work executable covers public compilation,
pool selection, typed access, claims, panic reasons and preserved failure
state, Mailbox ordering and wraparound, hierarchical Machine transitions,
Reactor startup and cooperative scheduling, topic publication and
zero-recipient reclamation, Timer delivery and ownership, cancellation, and
Port callback paths. The CMake test targets run both executables in the
available host configurations. Configuration-variant, property, and sanitizer
matrices remain outside the current host test target.
<<<
